                                                "sense_id": "842e8ccb-af96-3f11-9aef-638782b8ae68",
                                                "text": "Testing includes using a pen or finger to test for the “near point of convergence,” as well as a phoropter, which uses lenses and prisms to test the eyes’ ability to work together."
